<title>GUYANA: CRICKET-INDIA V WEST INDIES 5TH TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA V WEST INDIES 5TH TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<text>
<p>GEORGETOWN, Guyana, April 21, Scoreboard on the final day of</p>
<p>the fifth test between West Indies and India at Bourda on</p>
<p>Monday.</p>
<p>India first innings (overnight 241-4):</p>
<p>   A.Jadeja c Browne b Bishop		8</p>
<p>   N.Sidhu c Hooper b Walsh		 36</p>
<p>   R.Dravid c Hooper b Rose		 92</p>
<p>   S.Tendulkar c and b Bishop	     83</p>
<p>   M.Azharuddin c Browne b Rose	   31</p>
<p>   N.Mongia c Hooper b Rose		 39</p>
<p>   A.Kumble c Walsh b Hooper		15</p>
<p>   S.Joshi c Browne b Chanderpaul	  7</p>
<p>   D.Ganesh c Browne b Hooper		7</p>
<p>   A.Kuruvilla c bishop b Hooper	   5</p>
<p>   V.Prasad not out			    0</p>
<p>   Extras (b-8, lb-8, w-3, nb-13)	 32</p>
<p>   Total					 355</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-32 2-68 3-231 4-241 5-280 6-303 7-322</p>
<p>8-343 9-354.</p>
<p>Bowling: Ambrose 29-14-36-0 (nb4, w1), Bishop 31-9-61-2</p>
<p>(nb3), Rose 33.1-7-90-3 (nb4), Walsh 28.2-9-62-1 (nb1), Hooper</p>
<p>18-7-34-3, Chanderpaul 29-8-56-1 (nb1, w2).</p>
